\f0\fs24 \cf0 "I've been buying HMT mechanical watches for years, but navigating the original website always felt outdated\'97it lacked the emotional warmth and dignity that an iconic brand like HMT deserves.\
Looking at this redesigned version, the hero section with 'A Legacy. Wound by Hand Since 1961' instantly captures the emotional value of the brand. The 'Our Heritage' section and 'Scroll Through Time' feature treat these watches like living historical artifacts rather than just listed SKUs.\
Furthermore, key specifications like Movement, Case Diameter, and Water Resistance are cleanly organized right on the product view instead of being buried. It bridges the gap between classic Indian horology and modern luxury web design beautifully."}